	.SBTTL	SLCND - SL's conditionals for the MS 0515

; The console of the MS 0515 is the ROM's, and it is a VT52: it obeys BS,
; CR, ESC A/B/C/D, ESC H, ESC J, ESC K and ESC Y.  It does not know
; ESC [ - it drops the bracket and prints the rest - and it does not
; answer when asked what it is.  So SL is built for the VT52 alone: it
; asks nothing and sends nothing the console would print.

VT52$	= 1
VT100$	= 0
VT102$	= 0
